    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fd4e64d76635adcdcfd4d95",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "至今的一切准备都是为了赢得“凯旋门赏”。\n无论实力还是声望……目前皆处于逆风。\n正因如此才更须精准判断发起挑战的时机。",
      "source_fingerprint": "388b416fc3045588511a351929ea918a781b80187c632557cc485fd307ddf64e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
