    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cf8b90c349bad846e91a756",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山庆典借由“京成杯”来测试实力，\n确认自己是否足以挑战海外。\n今天正是命运的第一个分歧点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4a91b8cc1e10d745e7cdf0c1f6414cfc9fe90d9e482138f88e6db21d0d2748c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049409.json",
