    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3348abda97e3f617739f7fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山庆典将参赛“皋月赏”。\n这让东瀛佐敦感到愤怒，\n质问道“你明明说过自己没有目标”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4c0d357134e45c5d27bde39fff7725b392f32624ba25b38f77263ad9ec91fdf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049410.json",
      "json_path": [
