    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9cad27723f5c319462ea851",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一定得为以前的导师带来希望，\n绝不能跑出不堪的败绩。\n──来吧，赌局开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edfae2f1aade4b641bfe1691d227ed52dc9cc16038d2cf3798ad6bede10604c7",
