    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5823475cd181dd0b9f0e65e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同时中山庆典则是跟训练员聊起\n橡树大赛赛马娘，社会大众似乎\n都很期待看见那位赛马娘进军海外。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d9623e7f55af4e8efaabf92820714f97382ecaec7e4a250f7dd9b7c342cbd11",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
