    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3eb1a9348758dd5d117486a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不同于自己的希望之光。\n骰子在时代趋势的洪流之中已脱手掷出。\n──“日本德比”即将开幕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6a5207aa8653982ed69b1c47fc37d1603c4fc9605efe85ac4cb211bfe0019ce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
