    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d55166988434f5133daee587",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山庆典展现的希望帮助东瀛佐敦\n克服了伤势。接下来两人将同场对决，\n这场比赛将为他人带来希望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7bd8019cfaca8f328db1cabdec68be36e08c916cfdacb66de6f97366d15e04d",
