    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bd71f20ad3f7814a231fc8b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这场比赛，\n每一个对手都为了爬上颠峰倾注全力。\n中山庆典感受活着的感觉露出开心的笑容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c96b13b9d83f9141326048f6fdd89e01174f685eeaa1f1ebacaa08a21f8c1636",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
