      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以前曾指导过她的女老师\n请求训练员“帮助她好好活着”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52839799b9ee59590a485aa7caa0a9cfca33070d265478be0850711f988abbdc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
