    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2650cd9248e98022797ebee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接下来将正式为“凯旋门赏”做准备。\n为了掌握胜绩必须获取情报，\n经典级这一年将专注于收集资讯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a222f198e1b338a8ee62323ac18883ae734e74a447f35328dbc5d65dcccade13",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
