    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4fa83faceb0b4ce261d7274",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下一个目标是GⅢ“京成杯”。\n该场地的赛道跟“凯旋门赏”一样有陡坡。\n放手一搏的赌局即将开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30c0d31136c3ad09313134d9e8dd0e52f11b3a38a74aedb048471ea7f2c1f6c1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
