    {
      "uid": "zhcn:793044d4cf8ff0a15e714e69",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而他们紧接着听到惊人的事实。\n以前的导师……剩不到一年的寿命。\n……才刚跟她约好要赢下世界的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25236c5a9ddfc13beea4d7454cc1a7fd749f46f22e01b06e767373a4cc99e7a5",
